      "changelog": "xiaozhi-teach-solo-dashboard v1.0.0\n\n- Initial release of the 独立教师工作台 skill.\n- Combines seven key information areas—课表、课前/课后、作业、家长、课时包等—into a single daily teacher dashboard.\n- Automatically detects and flags student risks (如缺课、作业拖延、课时包不足等) based only on objective data fields.\n- Outputs \"今日三件事\" prioritized by urgency and impact, helping teachers focus on what matters most each day.\n- Strictly follows solo-teacher-workspace.schema.json, without fabricating student status or sending any automatic parent messages.",
